                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.00 R 294/430: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Herrick</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-01-19T14:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 19,
                                1925—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 19—11:49
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>70. L–331. Reference Department’s L–204. Advised National Bank Belgium cabled
                    Federal Reserve releasing account January 16.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>Logan</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herrick</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
